{
    "title": "KSUKI - Infinite Comics",
    "description": "Are you passionate about manga and comics but you have no space for your collection?\u00a0\r\n\r\nWould you like to read comics digitally and support their authors?\r\n\r\nIf so, KSUKI is for you!\r\n\r\nReading comics online has many advantages. For example, you can zoom in, turn the pages vertically or horizontally, and even leave comments and notes without having to damage the pages. Plus, you won't be wasting space, because you can access KSUKI and read\u00a0on your smartphone or tablet device, whether online or offline.\r\n\u00a0\r\n\r\n\u00a0\r\nReading digital comics is cheaper, which\u00a0allows you to discover series that in physical format would be out of\u00a0reach.\u00a0Besides,\u00a0you can also\u00a0read comics online for free on KSUKI! Part of the catalog is\u00a0for free,\u00a0so you can discover new\u00a0titles. And if you don't know what\u00a0to read next, the community can give you some recommendations, just ask!\u00a0The KSUKI\u00a0reading experience is social! You can comment and share impressions with other comics lovers, be guided by their recommendations and even\u00a0discover new gems that are waiting to be read by you.\r\n\r\nPlus,\u00a0if you enjoy organizing your\u00a0collection, KSUKI allows\u00a0you to\u00a0do it by demographics, genres or any other\u00a0criteria - the shelf full of comics you've always dreamed of!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Are you passionate about manga and comics but you have no space for your collection?\u00a0<br><br>Would you like to read comics digitally and support their authors?<br><br>If so, KSUKI is for you!<br><br>Reading comics online has many advantages. For example, you can zoom in, turn the pages vertically or horizontally, and even leave comments and notes without having to damage the pages. Plus, you won&#39;t be wasting space, because you can access KSUKI and read\u00a0on your smartphone or tablet device, whether online or offline.<br>\u00a0<br><br>\u00a0<br>Reading digital comics is cheaper, which\u00a0allows you to discover series that in physical format would be out of\u00a0reach.\u00a0Besides,\u00a0you can also\u00a0read comics online for free on KSUKI! Part of the catalog is\u00a0for free,\u00a0so you can discover new\u00a0titles. And if you don&#39;t know what\u00a0to read next, the community can give you some recommendations, just ask!\u00a0The KSUKI\u00a0reading experience is social! You can comment and share impressions with other comics lovers, be guided by their recommendations and even\u00a0discover new gems that are waiting to be read by you.<br><br>Plus,\u00a0if you enjoy organizing your\u00a0collection, KSUKI allows\u00a0you to\u00a0do it by demographics, genres or any other\u00a0criteria - the shelf full of comics you&#39;ve always dreamed of!",
